00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.575
A2.2 · Tools and MCP

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:10.456
MCP is an open standard for connecting assistants to other systems.

3
00:00:10.506 --> 00:00:16.462
A system publishes its tools once; any assistant that supports MCP can use them.

4
00:00:17.612 --> 00:00:20.631
The agent sees what the connected account sees.

5
00:00:20.681 --> 00:00:24.503
Give write tools only to the people, and agents, who need them.

